<title>ROMANIA: Port conditions update - Romania - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Romania - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>BUCHAREST, April 15 - Sulina Channel was reopened at 0640 local , April 15.</p>
<p>CONSTANTA, April 15 - Port was reopened at 0745 local, April 15.</p>
